Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.63,0:00:03.91,Default,,0,0,0,,The privacy story has three distinct layers. Shielded Zcash protects payment
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.92,0:00:07.36,Default,,0,0,0,,information on the public chain. Blind issuance removes the direct cryptographic
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.37,0:00:10.77,Default,,0,0,0,,payment to usage link. Optional verified Tor transport in the CLI
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.78,0:00:15.45,Default,,0,0,0,,reduces source network exposure. Timing, browser behavior, query contents, and compromised
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.46,0:00:19.11,Default,,0,0,0,,devices can still reveal information. BlindPass does not promise total anonymity.
